差\n音色质感：清亮女声，通过刻意湿润感和颤抖音强化“绿茶”人设，非真实哭腔\n清晰度：吐字清晰，通过“giegie”等刻意错误发音强化表演效果\n流畅度：整体连贯，通过刻意设计的吸气、停顿和重复（如“吃一个…同一个棒棒糖”）增强戏剧性\n情绪：表面关切（假意担忧）→ 刻意挑拨 → 虚伪对比（自我标榜）\n语调：语调起伏大，句尾常带刻意拖长音（如“giegie~~~”），通过夸张上扬营造矫揉造作感\n语气：表面无辜体贴，实则暗含挑拨和讽刺，通过反差感制造喜剧效果"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CR Text", "mode": 4, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [400, 200], "pos": [367.4045715332031, 2122.744140625], "id": 31, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text"}, "order": 3}, {"outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [23], "label": "text", "type": "*", "localized_name": "text"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "show_help", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["哥哥，你给我买这个棒棒糖，你女朋友不会生气吧？哎，真好吃，哥，你尝一口，哥哥！咱俩吃一个，同一个棒棒糖，你女朋友知道了不会吃醋吧？哥哥，你骑着小电动车带着我，你女朋友知道了不会揍我吧？你女朋友好可怕，不像我，只会心疼哥哥！"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CR Text", "mode": 4, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [400, 200], "pos": [367.40447998046875, 1860.6693115234375], "id": 30, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text"}, "order": 4}, {"mode": 4, "outputs": [{"name": "模型", "links": [22], "label": "模型", "type": "QWEN3_TTS_MODEL", "localized_name": "模型"}], "size": [270, 106], "pos": [387.276611328125, 1703.2086181640625], "widgets_values": ["Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-CustomVoice", "cuda", "fp16"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "模型名称"}, "name": "模型名称", "label": "模型名称", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "模型名称"}, {"widget": {"name": "运行设备"}, "name": "运行设备", "label": "运行设备", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "运行设备"}, {"widget": {"name": "精度"}, "name": "精度", "label": "精度", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "精度"}], "flags": {}, "id": 28, "type": "Qwen3TTSModelLoader", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Qwen3TTSMode